  "summary": "<p>“This historic win gives us control over a massive part of the world&#8217;s oil supply.” – President Donald J. Trump Yesterday in Corpus Christi, Texas, President Donald J. Trump announced the arrival of the first million barrels of oil secured by the Trump Administration as part of the President’s historic Venezuela oil deal –  with all oil coming to America [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/president-trump-announces-arrival-of-first-one-million-barrels-of-oil-in-texas-thanks-to-historic-oil-deal/\">President Trump Announces Arrival of First One Million Barrels of Oil in Texas Thanks to Historic Oil Deal</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
