t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><em>“This historic win gives us control over a massive part of the world&#8217;s oil supply.” – President Donald J. Trump</em><em></em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yesterday in Corpus Christi, Texas, President Donald J. Trump announced the arrival of <strong>the first million barrels of oil <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/08/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-announces-historic-oil-agreement-to-secure-american-energy-dominance-and-drive-venezuelas-economic-recovery/\">secured</a> by </strong>the Trump Administration as part of the President’s historic Venezuela oil deal –  with all oil coming to America at no cost to the United States or the American taxpayer. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This first shipment of oil will be refined in the Lone Star State, supporting American jobs, and <strong>increasing domestic supply to lower Americans’ prices at the pump.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From Alaska to Texas, President Trump is unleashing America’s energy dominance— making the Western Hemisphere the energy capital of the world – and Americans will benefit as gasoline and diesel prices come plummeting down!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2115169881977155917?s=20\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"519\" height=\"316\" src=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-28-at-8.12.08-AM.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-53554\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">President Trump’s bold foreign policy is driving America First wins: this&nbsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2093470778876453215?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">deal</a>&nbsp;more than doubles our strategic reserves— delivering 65 billion barrels in total, dramatically bolsters our oil supply, and helps deliver lower gas prices for the American people—costing taxpayers nothing!&nbsp;<strong>No other President and no other Administration could deliver such historic results for the American people.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">President Trump continues to secure major deals to unleash energy dominance and reverse the Democrats’ failed anti-energy and Green New Scam policies to cut energy costs for all Americans.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/president-trump-announces-arrival-of-first-one-million-barrels-of-oil-in-texas-thanks-to-historic-oil-deal/\">President Trump Announces Arrival of First One Million Barrels of Oil in Texas Thanks to Historic Oil Deal</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
  "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T12:57:17.834597+00:00"
}
